B.Yc=s(["I arrive in Tbilisi and step out of the airport.",'A taxi driver smiles and says: "gamarjoba!" \u2014 hello!','I say "gamarjoba" back, then ask "sad aris sastumo?" \u2014 where is the hotel?','He points and says "pirdapir, martskhniv" \u2014 straight ahead, then left.','At the hotel I say "madloba" \u2014 thank you \u2014 and he replies "ar aris ra" \u2014 you\'re welcome.',"I am hungry, so I walk to a nearby restaurant.",'The menu shows "khinkali" \u2014 Georgian dumplings filled with spiced meat and broth.','I say "momitanet khinkali tu sheidzleba" \u2014 please bring me khinkali.','The khinkali arrive and I take one bite: "gemrielia!" \u2014 delicious!','After eating I say "ra ghirs?" \u2014 how much? \u2014 and pay in lari.'],t.s)
B.Mr=new A.d1("ka_p1","Tbilisi First Day","Beginner","Travel",B.Yc,"ka")
B.W_=s(["My Georgian friend invites me to a supra \u2014 a traditional feast.","The table is covered with dishes: khinkali, khachapuri, mtsvadi, and badrijani.","Everyone sits down and the tamada \u2014 toastmaster \u2014 stands up.","He raises a glass of ghvino \u2014 wine \u2014 and begins the first toast.",'The whole table shouts "gaumarjos!" \u2014 cheers!','I try the khachapuri and say "gemrielia!" \u2014 delicious!','My friend laughs and says in Georgian with a wink: "dzalian mikvars khachapuri" \u2014 I love khachapuri very much.','The tamada gives another toast: "gaumarjos sakartvelos!" \u2014 to Georgia!','I learn a few words: "mshvenieria" \u2014 it\'s beautiful \u2014 and use them to describe the evening.','At the end I say "didi madloba" \u2014 thank you very much \u2014 for this wonderful night.'],t.s)
B.Mv=new A.d1("ka_p2","Georgian Supra","Beginner","Culture",B.W_,"ka")
